    <bpmn:process id="W_W3338" name="W3338. Employee Engagement Pulse, Survey Operations &amp; Action Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual/pulse cycle; complements VS-84.3 engagement
Frequency: Annual + quarterly pulse
Volume: 6,932 employees
Owner: Employee Experience Manager
Participants: EX Manager, People Analytics (links to VS-103.3), Managers, Comms (links to VS-103.2), CHRO
Source: workflow W3338 — Employee Engagement Pulse, Survey Operations &amp; Action Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3338_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3338_Lane1" name="EX Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3338_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3338_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3338_Lane2" name="People Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3338_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3338_Lane3" name="Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3338_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3338_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3338_Start5" name="Annual/pulse cycle; complements VS-84.3 engagement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3338_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3338_Task6" name="EX Manager/People Analytics design and run engagement surveys (annual) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EX Manager/People Analytics design and run engagement surveys (annual) and pulses (quarterly): items (engagement drivers, enablement, manager effectiveness, wellbeing), confidentiality, and channel (mobile-friendly for store staff)
Responsible (R): EX Manager / People Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3338_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3338_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3338_Task7" name="People Analytics analyze results by segment (store/DC/HQ, tenure, entity)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: People Analytics analyze results by segment (store/DC/HQ, tenure, entity), identify drivers and hotspots, and share team-level results with managers for action planning; coordinate with labor-relations engagement (links to VS-84.3 W2889)
Responsible (R): People Analytics / Managers
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3338_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3338_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3338_Task8" name="Managers/EX Manager build and execute action plans, track progress, communicate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Managers/EX Manager build and execute action plans, track progress, communicate &quot;you said / we did&quot; (links to VS-103.2), and measure engagement movement over time (links to VS-103.3)
Responsible (R): Managers / EX Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3338_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3338_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3338_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3338_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3338_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-539 (ensure controlled execution — Employee Experience, Engagement &amp; Internal Communications (PA-103.2).) | - operational: cadence and visible action; operational: mobile access and manager advocacy
Owner: Employee Experience Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3338_Assoc11" sourceRef="W3338_Annotation10" targetRef="W3338_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
