    <bpmn:process id="W_W3339" name="W3339. Internal Communications, Intranet &amp; Company-Wide Broadcast Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; major announcement
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Enterprise-wide audience
Owner: Internal Communications Manager
Participants: Internal Comms Mgr, EX (links to VS-103.2), Store Comms (links to VS-63), Marketing (links to VS-14.3), Leadership
Source: workflow W3339 — Internal Communications, Intranet &amp; Company-Wide Broadcast Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3339_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3339_Lane1" name="Internal Comms Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3339_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3339_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3339_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3339_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3339_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3339_Start3" name="Continuous; major announcement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3339_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3339_Task4" name="Internal Comms Mgr operate the intranet and comms channels (email, mobile app…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Internal Comms Mgr operate the intranet and comms channels (email, mobile app links to VS-75, store communication links to VS-63, digital signage, bulletin boards for stores): content publishing, segmentation by audience (store/DC/HQ/entity), and scheduling
Responsible (R): Internal Comms Mgr
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3339_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3339_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3339_Task5" name="Internal Comms Mgr/Leadership craft company-wide broadcasts (strategy, results…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Internal Comms Mgr/Leadership craft company-wide broadcasts (strategy, results, policy, recognition, change) with clear, consistent messaging; coordinate with marketing brand (links to VS-14.3) and store task management (links to VS-63) for store reach
Responsible (R): Internal Comms Mgr / Leadership
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per broadcast</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3339_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3339_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3339_Task6" name="Internal Comms Mgr measure reach/engagement (open rates, read receipts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Internal Comms Mgr measure reach/engagement (open rates, read receipts, feedback), optimize channel mix, and ensure two-way flow (links to W3342 feedback); manage crisis-comms coordination (links to VS-14.3 W134/W1562)
Responsible (R): Internal Comms Mgr
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3339_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3339_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3339_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3339_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3339_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-539 (ensure controlled execution — Employee Experience, Engagement &amp; Internal Communications (PA-103.2).) | - operational: segmentation and prioritization; operational: multi-channel and store-comms integration (links to VS-63)
Owner: Internal Communications Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3339_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3339_Annotation8" targetRef="W3339_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
