    <bpmn:process id="W_W3344" name="W3344. Employee Value Proposition, Culture &amp; EX Measurement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; strategic refresh
Frequency: Annual
Volume: Enterprise
Owner: Employee Experience Manager
Participants: EX Manager, CHRO, Marketing/Brand (links to VS-14.3), People Analytics (links to VS-103.3), Leadership
Source: workflow W3344 — Employee Value Proposition, Culture &amp; EX Measurement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3344_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3344_Lane1" name="EX Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3344_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3344_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3344_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3344_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3344_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3344_Start3" name="Annual review; strategic refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3344_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3344_Task4" name="EX Manager/CHRO define and maintain the Employee Value Proposition (EVP)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EX Manager/CHRO define and maintain the Employee Value Proposition (EVP): rewards (links to VS-102), development (links to VS-19.4), purpose, work environment, leadership, and culture pillars; align to employer brand (links to VS-14.3)
Responsible (R): EX Manager / CHRO
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3344_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3344_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3344_Task5" name="EX Manager measure EX across the journey (onboard W3337, daily work…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EX Manager measure EX across the journey (onboard W3337, daily work, development, recognition, lifecycle events) via EX metrics (journey CSAT, eNPS, moments-that-matter), and correlate to engagement (W3338) and retention (links to VS-103.3)
Responsible (R): EX Manager / People Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3344_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3344_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3344_Task6" name="EX Manager/CHRO use EX insight to prioritize investments (rewards, tools…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EX Manager/CHRO use EX insight to prioritize investments (rewards, tools, managers), report EX health to leadership (links to VS-33.2), and refresh EVP/culture strategy
Responsible (R): EX Manager / CHRO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3344_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3344_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3344_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3344_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3344_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-539 (ensure controlled execution — Employee Experience, Engagement &amp; Internal Communications (PA-103.2).) | - operational: EX measurement and action; operational: journey-based metrics
Owner: Employee Experience Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
